  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0008_97a09411da94.png\"><br>\r\nAs intermolecular force varies as:\r\nH bonding > dipole dipole force > vander waals force\r\n$\\therefore$ boiling point order\r\n$\\mathrm{n}$-butanol $>$ butanone $>\\mathrm{n}$-Pentane $>$ iso pentane"
